  "full_text": "So I want to show Diana something she can work on. So there's a graphics routine that plots an ellipse. It attempts to transform it by rotating the major and minor axis. I thought... Okay, so... So God hates the European Space Agency because they stole from NASA. Wow. I felt kind of embarrassed that I reinvented everything from scratch. Like when I did my graphics, I just did it off the top of my head. So let's go to our songs. Okay, control D. I'm going to show you a problem with the ellipse. So I'm going to go ahead and copy the song to my home directory. That's where I work on things in my home directory. So we're going to, right now we have some sprites. Okay, so we're going to draw an ellipse. Control-R, make sprite. Let's draw a circle and an ellipse. Okay, so let's, what the heck, thickness. Four couple circles. Okay, good enough. So I'm going to straighten it up. So we're going to go to the edit menu and shift points. So now we're going to grab these. Okay, good enough. And exit. So now we're going to, these fuckers are doing crazy stuff. So before we, oh well. We're going to change this to sprite number one. So I did my I did my... Oh, we have to... Okay, so I did my... I did my graphics routines by myself from scratch. And they... I got... I tried even harder than... I think it's... Maybe Diana can be so kind as to make this better. Mrs. Smarty Pants. So I transformed the major and minor axis. I think that's what I do. But I think I did something even more sophisticated. Anyway, like a circle, as a matter of fact. Okay, never mind. So, yeah, how about that, Diana? Can you make yourself useful? No. She thinks she's too smart to work on God's temple. No. She's too smart. Fuck you.",
